Core concept first
Work Formula
Work=Time×Efficiency

Yahi poore chapter ki रीढ़ hai.

Sabse important idea: Efficiency

Jo aadmi kam time leta hai → woh zyada efficient hai.

Example:

A finishes work in 10 days
B in 20 days

Toh:
A is twice as efficient as B.

