repeat

Yahan cycle method use hota hai.

8. Partial work then leaving

Very common.

Example:

A and B start work
after 3 days B leaves
remaining by A

Questions long lagte hain, but bas work split hota hai.

9. Different efficiencies

Example:
A is 2x efficient as B.

Then:
If B = 1 unit/day
A = 2 units/day

Total = 3 units/day

10. LCM method (Most powerful shortcut)

Ye toppers ka weapon hai ⚔️

Instead of fractions:
Take total work = LCM of days.

Example:

A = 10 days
B = 15 days

Take total work:

LCM(10,15)=30

Then:

A does 3 units/day
B does 2 units/day

Together = 5 units/day

Time:

30/5=6 days

Cleaner. Faster. Less mistakes.

